# Keep Rules Updated

Update `types-workflow.mdc` in the same session whenever any of these change:

| Change Made | What to Update in types-workflow.mdc |
|-------------|--------------------------------------|
| New section type added | Add to "Current Section Types" list |
| Section type removed or deprecated | Remove from list, note deprecation |
| `linksWithContact` fully migrated and removed | Remove from list |
| Build process changes (`tsconfig`, output dir, etc.) | Update "Making Changes" section |
| Install method changes (GitHub → npm or other) | Update "Package Distribution" section |
| `SCHEMA_VERSION` bumped | Update version references |
| New field type added (`FieldDefinition`) | Update "Section Definition Structure" section |

Also update **`pages-mobile/.cursor/rules/section-development.mdc`** and **`pages/.cursor/rules/section-components.mdc`** whenever section types are added or removed — those rules list section types too.
